NeoB0x 1.00  fork of MarOS15-V1.82 (2026-08-29)
	+ randomizer scales: phrygian, locrian, mixolydian + scale-aware
	  UP/DOWN transpose; selected scale persists in the existing
	  MarOS-compatible EEPROM slot
	+ fixed: settings defaults bit masks, note 42 held-notes leak, LED
	  index bounds check, atomic swing timeouts, MIDI RX queue overflow,
	  UART pattern bounds check, tempo EEPROM wear (debounced writes)
	+ fixed: pattern clear (double-click F) now fills all steps, undo
	  restores the full 16-byte pattern
	+ auto-stop when the external clock is lost (keeps unsaved edits in
	  sync'd edit mode)
	+ fixed: external Start after clock idle no longer immediately triggers
	  clock-loss auto-stop
	+ reports own c0nb0x identity: osID 42, name "NEOB0X", version 100
	  ("1.00")
	+ Makefile build (Linux/macOS), CI + automated releases
